## Entry for the Table of Contents
Zirconium-based Metal-Organic Framework (Zr-MOF) UiO-66 catalyzes the degradation of plastics polyethylene terephthalate (PET) into monomers. During degradation process, UiO-66 transforms into another Zr-MOF MIL-140 which also shows good catalytic reactivity for the degradation of PET.
